  "summary": "allowIfSubTypeIsArray() approving every array (`Evil[]`) regardless of element\ntype. BasicPolymorphicTypeValidator.Builder.allowIfSubTypeIsArray() was added in\n2.10.1 (@since 2.10.1): 2.10.0 has no such method and no other matcher that\napproves arrays as such, so an array type id is only accepted if a configured\nname/class matcher accepts the array class itself. The type-parameter/array-component validation that upstream\nadded with the same fix ([databind#5988]) is applied here as CVE-2026-54512.\n",
